    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u201cI am willing to give everything to become the protagonist in your story, even if I am the ANTAGONIST in the script.\u201d</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1788060/extras/a80478696d4280472c56301b84c06ae8.avif?t=1754151403\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Abandoned Hansel and Gretel follow the sweet aroma to the candy house. Strangely, although the candy house appears full of wonderful things, it is permeated by an eerie atmosphere. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The two encounter a moody doll, playful and mischievous teddy bears, elusive gingerbread twins, and a witch shrouded in mystery... The sweets here not only satisfy hunger but are also key to unraveling the many mysteries. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Develop recipes, collect ingredients</i></strong>, create various magical sweets, and record them in the <strong><i>dessert book</i></strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some sweets can be used as weapons, increase intelligence, even change form, and can attract mysterious creatures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every step they take is fraught with danger, and <strong><i>every choice they make will alter the course of the story.</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can Hansel and Gretel uncover the dark conspiracies hidden beneath the sweet sugar coating?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u201cI am willing to give everything to become the protagonist in your story, even if I am the ANTAGONIST in the script.\u201d</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1788060/extras/a80478696d4280472c56301b84c06ae8.avif?t=1754151403\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Abandoned Hansel and Gretel follow the sweet aroma to the candy house. Strangely, although the candy house appears full of wonderful things, it is permeated by an eerie atmosphere. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The two encounter a moody doll, playful and mischievous teddy bears, elusive gingerbread twins, and a witch shrouded in mystery... The sweets here not only satisfy hunger but are also key to unraveling the many mysteries. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Develop recipes, collect ingredients</i></strong>, create various magical sweets, and record them in the <strong><i>dessert book</i></strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some sweets can be used as weapons, increase intelligence, even change form, and can attract mysterious creatures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every step they take is fraught with danger, and <strong><i>every choice they make will alter the course of the story.</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can Hansel and Gretel uncover the dark conspiracies hidden beneath the sweet sugar coating?</p>",
    "short_description": "An RPG in which you make desserts to uncover mysteries. Choices may affect endings. The abandoned siblings encountered a good witch, a freaky doll, and gingerbread twins, they disclose sugary &quot;lies&quot;\u2014revealing the candy house's rewritten history and a selfish truth related to their past...",
